OL,5,G0100 Clive Davis - The Last Record Man
OL,6,     FRecord executive Clive Davis has
OL,7,     Fhelped many on their way to
OL,8,     Fstardom. Paul Gambaccini tells his
OL,9,     Fstory and attempts to discover how
OL,10,     Fhe's spotted so many hit records
OL,11,     Fand artists.
OL,12,G0200 Tony Blackburn's Sounds of Soul
OL,13,     FTony has a very special show,
OL,14,     Fcelebrating the best in British
OL,15,     Fsoul music as part of the BBC's
OL,16,     FMusic Is Black season, in
OL,17,     Fconjunction with the V&A East
OL,18,     FMuseum.
